# ${APP_NAME} — autonomous build loop

Runbook for this project's autonomous build loop. Theory, design rationale, and limitations:
[kmp-forge docs/autoloop.md](https://github.com/arthurnagy/kmp-forge/blob/main/docs/autoloop.md).
Installed by `/kmp-forge-add-autoloop` on ${SCAFFOLD_DATE}.

## Launch

```
/loop /kmp-forge-next-increment
```

One invocation = one full increment: pop the top backlog slice → docs PR → spec gate → code PR → code gate → auto-merge both → tick the backlog. `/loop` provides the repetition; the loop stops when the queue is empty, on `openspec/STOP`, or on escalation.

